{"id":"progreso","lemma":"progreso","pos":"noun","rank":2343,"glosses":["progress, headway, advancement"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈɡɾeso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"progresos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-progreso.wav","examples":[{"text":"El trabajo ahora está en progreso.","en":"The work is now in progress.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Estamos haciendo muchos progresos.","en":"We're making great progress.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526848","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"¿Ha habido algún progreso?","en":"Has there been any progress?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615941","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,null]},{"text":"Estoy satisfecho con su progreso.","en":"I'm satisfied with his progress.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/607905","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"satisfied"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"No hay progreso sin comunicación.","en":"There is no progress without communication.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061867","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"without"},{"g":"communication"}]}]}